1.5 **"Quantitative Models and Alpha Pipelines"** means all mathematical formulas, regime transition matrices, causal envelopes, squeeze calculators, voltrend models, options pricing estimators, order flow feature extractors, and trade secret algorithms embodied in the Software.

1.6 **"Commercial Purpose"** means any use intended to generate revenue, profit, commercial advantage, financial gain, or direct/indirect monetary return, including but not limited to fee-based services, subscription products, consulting, proprietary trading for profit, fund management, or SaaS hosting.

